title: "DOR transcriptomics minimal reproducible code"
version: "1.0.1"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Privacy-screened analysis and accepted-figure code for a phenotype- and
  provenance-aware cross-cohort transcriptomic study of diminished ovarian
  reserve in human ovarian granulosa cells.
